CREATE TABLE "CommunicationPreference" ("customerId" TEXT PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES "Customer"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"doNotDisturb" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"emailGranted" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"emailOptedOut" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"voiceGranted" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"evidence" TEXT NOT NULL,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE "CommunicationDispatch" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"customerId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Customer"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"channel" TEXT NOT NULL CHECK ("channel" IN ('SMS','EMAIL','CALL','INTERNAL')),"template" TEXT NOT NULL,"destination" TEXT NOT NULL,"subject" TEXT,"body" TEXT NOT NULL,"sourceKind" TEXT,"sourceId" TEXT,"sourceHash" TEXT,"dueAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'DRAFT',"idempotencyKey" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"payloadHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"providerId" TEXT UNIQUE,"errorCode" TEXT,"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"approvedBy" TEXT,"approvedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE INDEX "CommunicationDispatch_customerId_createdAt_idx" ON "CommunicationDispatch"("customerId","createdAt");
CREATE INDEX "CommunicationDispatch_status_dueAt_idx" ON "CommunicationDispatch"("status","dueAt");
CREATE TABLE "CommunicationNote" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"customerId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Customer"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"callSid" TEXT REFERENCES "PhoneCall"("sid") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"body" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE INDEX "CommunicationNote_customerId_createdAt_idx" ON "CommunicationNote"("customerId","createdAt");
CREATE TABLE "CommunicationProof" ("provider" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"fingerprint" TEXT NOT NULL,"verified" BOOLEAN NOT NULL,"detail" TEXT NOT NULL,"checkedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
